# The three images are built with the repository root as the context, and
# none of them copies a file out of it: every one of them starts FROM a
# public base image and installs what it needs.  The toolchain image used to
# copy the `rsi` package into the bundle; it does not any more, because the
# rollouts run mini in its default mode.
#
# What is left below is what would be *large* if it were sent: the task
# registries (1.3 GB), the extracted tasks, the pilot registries and the
# converted datasets.
.venv
.venv312
.git
.cache
.pytest_cache
*.egg-info
__pycache__
*.pyc
.DS_Store
datasets/base
opencode_sft/registry
opencode_sft/registry_clawgym
opencode_sft/tasks
opencode_sft/pilot
opencode_sft/dataset
opencode_sft/mini_sft/dataset
opencode_sft/clawgym/dataset
runs
ledger
